  "claim": "Victor John Mature, an American stage, film, and television actor appeared in a large number of musicals, and played Samson in the 1949 film \"Samson and Delilah\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Samson and Delilah (1984 film). Sentence: Samson and Delilah is a 1984 television film adaptation of the biblical story of Samson and Delilah, starring Max von Sydow, Belinda Bauer, Antony Hamilton, Daniel Stern and Victor Mature.\nPage: Victor Mature. Sentence: Victor John Mature (January 29, 1913 – August 4, 1999) was an American stage, film, and television actor who starred most notably in several Biblical movies during the 1950s, and was known for his dark good looks and mega-watt smile.\nPage: Victor Mature. Sentence: He also appeared in a large number of musicals opposite such stars as Rita Hayworth and Betty Grable.",
